# Q1. What are the child processes of X? (every parent and its children)
PREFIX skos: <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#>
PREFIX dcterms: <http://purl.org/dc/terms/>
PREFIX owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#>
PREFIX core: <https://w3id.org/lsc/ontology/modules/core/>
PREFIX mod: <https://w3id.org/lsc/ontology/modules/>
PREFIX apqc: <https://w3id.org/lsc/ontology/modules/core/apqc-mapping-decision/>

SELECT ?parent ?child WHERE { ?child skos:broader ?parent ; skos:inScheme mod:core . }
